Provenance. The files were taken from
https://github.com/otfabric/go-ocpp (schemas/, commit 191f845), which
records each OCA download URL and archive SHA-256 in its UPSTREAM.json and
every file's SHA-256 in its SHA256SUMS; every file here matched. The OCA
download page is https://openchargealliance.org/my-oca/ocpp/.

Where the specification text is stricter than a schema, the correction is
applied by the code generator (`SchemaPatch` in xtask/src/schema.rs), cited,
and never written into these files.

Checked. `schemas/SHA256SUMS` lists every file; `cargo xtask schemas-check`
(a CI job) fails if a file differs from it, or one is added or missing.

The OCPP specification PDFs are not redistributed with this repository.

